{'symbol': 'BSX', 'date': '2022-06-15 07:00:00', 'title': 'BOSTON SCIENTIFIC ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT TO PURCHASE MAJORITY STAKE OF M.I.TECH CO., LTD FROM SYNERGY INNOVATION CO., LTD', 'text': 'MARLBOROUGH, MASS. , JUNE 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BOSTON SCIENTIFIC CORPORATION (NYSE: BSX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT WITH SYNERGY INNOVATION CO., LTD, TO PURCHASE ITS MAJORITY STAKE (APPROXIMATELY 64 PERCENT) OF M.I.TECH CO., LTD, ("M.I.TECH") A PUBLICLY TRADED KOREAN MANUFACTURER AND DISTRIBUTOR OF MEDICAL DEVICES FOR ENDOSCOPIC AND UROLOGIC PROCEDURES.'}